1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:03,500
People paste medical bills into chatbots.

2
00:00:03,450 --> 00:00:07,459
The name, the member ID, and the phone number go with them.

3
00:00:07,459 --> 00:00:11,340
Callsheet does the reading on your own computer instead.

4
00:00:11,949 --> 00:00:15,298
This is a real explanation of benefits.

5
00:00:15,247 --> 00:00:19,219
The printed amount due is one hundred forty-six dollars.

6
00:00:19,219 --> 00:00:22,187
The lines add up to one hundred ten.

7
00:00:22,187 --> 00:00:24,987
Two visits carry the same code.

8
00:00:24,987 --> 00:00:26,731
Press read.

9
00:00:26,731 --> 00:00:30,494
The model runs here, through Firebase AI Logic.

10
00:00:30,494 --> 00:00:32,956
The bill is not uploaded.

11
00:00:33,570 --> 00:00:37,426
On-device is private, and it costs nothing to run.

12
00:00:37,375 --> 00:00:40,475
It is also slow, and it is small.

13
00:00:40,475 --> 00:00:45,656
So the device does what it is good at: it reads the document, and it
checks it.

14
00:00:45,656 --> 00:00:49,719
The cloud does what it is good at: it writes the questions.

15
00:00:49,719 --> 00:00:52,402
Between them is a sealed packet.

16
00:00:52,402 --> 00:00:55,709
No name, no member ID, no phone.

17
00:00:55,709 --> 00:00:58,039
The bill never crosses.

18
00:00:58,640 --> 00:01:01,284
This is the read from that run.

19
00:01:01,234 --> 00:01:04,424
Five lines, every amount editable.

20
00:01:04,424 --> 00:01:07,355
Nothing is sealed until you say so.

21
00:01:07,355 --> 00:01:09,033
Seal it.

22
00:01:09,033 --> 00:01:11,989
The cloud writes from the packet alone.

23
00:01:11,989 --> 00:01:15,531
The sheet puts the phone number back, locally.

24
00:01:15,531 --> 00:01:22,680
And the check the model cannot change: a made-up fee, a patient name,
a phone number, and an amount on the wrong code.

25
00:01:22,680 --> 00:01:25,948
All four are dropped, each with its reason.

26
00:01:26,569 --> 00:01:28,486
A private read.

27
00:01:28,435 --> 00:01:30,427
A sealed packet.

28
00:01:30,427 --> 00:01:33,200
A check the model cannot change.

29
00:01:33,200 --> 00:01:34,920
Callsheet.

30
00:01:34,920 --> 00:01:39,528
The code, the live demo, and the proof are in the repository.

